---
/** Always-available emergency entry. Deliberately separate from learning. */
---

<aside class="kq-help-strip" aria-labelledby="help-title">
  <div style="display:grid; gap:0.4rem">
    <p class="kq-eyebrow">Something went wrong?</p>
    <h2 id="help-title" class="kq-h3">Clicked a strange link or typed your password somewhere?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:0.95rem; opacity:0.85">Don’t panic. You get a short checklist for your situation. Nobody gets blamed.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem 1.25rem">
    <a class="kq-btn kq-btn--urgent kq-btn--lg" href="/report/">Get help now <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a class="kq-btn kq-btn--ghost" href="/status/">See the alert level</a>
  </div>
</aside>
